    |   +-FunctionCall(GoogleSQL:array_reduce(ARRAY<INT64> array_to_reduce, INT64 initial_value, FUNCTION<(INT64, INT64, INT64)->INT64> reducer, FUNCTION<INT64->INT64> finisher, optional(1) BOOL ignore_nulls) -> INT64)
    |     +-FunctionArgument
