  Signature: ARRAY_REDUCE(ARRAY<T1>, FUNCTION<(T1, T1)->T1>, FUNCTION<T1->T2>, [ignore_nulls => BOOL])
    Positional argument at 4 is invalid because argument `ignore_nulls` can only be referred to by name
